<title>AUSTRALIA: SBC leads A$100 mln note issue for Arnotts.</title>
<headline>SBC leads A$100 mln note issue for Arnotts.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said on Wednesday it has lead managed a A$100 million note issue for Arnotts Ltd from its A$200 million debt programme.</p>
<p>The notes mature August 15, 2000 and would carry a coupon of 6.0 percent.</p>
</text>
